[Android Studio](https://developer.android.com/studio). What does the file structure look like when it works and what when it doesn't work? _(I'm not familiar with C# stuff yet)_\r\n\r\n![image](https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/0f7bb691-17da-43d7-acb5-fa12771f5183)\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470446036/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470494433","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99021#issuecomment-2470494433","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99021","id":2470494433,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TQMDh","user":{"login":"fabianPas","id":776877,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc3Njg3Nw==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/776877?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas","html_url":"https://github.com/fabianPas","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fabianPas/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-12T13:11:14Z","updated_at":"2024-11-12T13:12:01Z","body":"Thank you Alex. I've updated the APK with a mega.io link. I've ran the .APK through the Android Studio analyzer. Nowhere do I see a 'cs' directory and neither a 'Flatty.so' file, there's a Flatty.dll file at both assets/.godot/mono/publish/x86_64 and assets/.godot/mono/publish/arm64. \r\n\r\nAnalyzing an exported APK from a newly created Android and C# project (AndroidTest) there's no 'AndroidTest.so' at both directories either. \r\n\r\nI believe the initial app startup is confused by something at first, which corrects (itself) the second time? \r\n\r\nAnyway, the conclusion to your question is that the file structures are equal in both exported .APKs.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2470494433/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2473457352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99021#issuecomment-2473457352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99021","id":2473457352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6TbfbI","user":{"login":"hpvb","id":2591099,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1OTEwOTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2591099?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb","html_url":"https://github.com/hpvb","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/hpvb/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-11-13T12:20:51Z","updated_at":"2024-11-13T12:20:51Z","body":"The problem in this case seems to be a bug in DirAccess on android. Due to one of the dependencies of this project some subdirectories are created in `assets/.godot/mono/publish/arm64/`:\r\n\r\n```\r\ndrwxr-xr-x.  2 hp hp  113 Nov 13 00:28 cs\r\n<snip>\r\ndrwxr-xr-x.  2 hp hp  113 Nov 13 00:28 zh-Hant\r\n```\r\n\r\nThe error comes from _copy_dir() not being able to read any of the subdirectories, but all of the normal files have already been copied to the cache directory by that point, so on subsequent runs the problem doesn't appear. This is partially just a lucky break since we do a breath first rather than a depth first copy.\r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2473457352/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808314525","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/99021#issuecomment-2808314525","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/99021","id":2808314525,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6nY3qd","user":{"login":"raulsntos","id":3903059,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5MDMwNTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/3903059?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos","html_url":"https://github.com/raulsntos","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/raulsntos/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-16T05:09:27Z","updated_at":"2025-04-16T05:09:27Z","body":"The crashing should be fixed by https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/105262 since we now avoid using the .NET assemblies extracted with `_copy_dir()` but the bug in DirAccess on Android likely still exists.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2808314525/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]